rd here runs from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 7 grids October to November came in under 90% of normal in 37 of 75 years. In 2025 that pair came in at 39% of normal on the middle of the grids, and September to October at 42%. Every grid had its driest year in 1954, with grid 14584 at 53%. For grid 14885 the preliminary estimate for August to September 2026 sits at 81.8.</p>"}
